      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "權限留在 host",
      "items": [
        "Hosted service 決定誰能觸發、能看哪些頻道、能用哪些 Discord actions",
        "Worker 只回報 capacity、repository availability 與可執行的 profile"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "一次 workflow，一個 worker",
      "items": [
        "routing、context retrieval、answering 原則上沿用同一個 reservation",
        "Codex App Server 保留 thread，支援 progress、steer、stop 與 continuation"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "工具不是模型的直通門",
      "items": [
        "MCP token 綁 requester、guild、channel、worker profile 與 repository",
        "Host 驗證 structured result，再把文字、reaction 或檔案送回 Discord"
